<p>We could now create a custom sort function for the "color" column, to ma=
ke
sure it sorts based on the "dec" attribute instead. Or, we could just tell
dynatable to sort the "color" column based on the "name" attribute
directly in our table with <code>data-dynatable-sorts</code>:</p>

<div class=3D"highlight"><pre><code class=3D"html"><span class=3D"nt">&lt;t=
able&gt;</span>
  <span class=3D"nt">&lt;thead&gt;</span>
    <span class=3D"nt">&lt;tr&gt;</span>
